  "description": "MAJFAJ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C90 H126 Br6 Gd6 N6 O42,1.5(C1 H4 O1),1.5(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd1 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd5 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd6 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.816-3.855 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 109.78-112.14°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C91.5H138Br6Gd6N6O49.",
